00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:56.004
There's instances of cities like this
here, too, that are built into the earth

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:58.381
There's several advantages to this.

00:04:58.381 --> 00:05:01.926
First, and most obvious
as protection from the heat.

00:05:02.051 --> 00:05:09.183
