00:05:09.267 --> 00:05:12.520
If you look at termite mounds,
they look solid from the outside.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:16.482
But from the inside, it's actually
really open, covered with tiny holes.

00:05:16.607 --> 00:05:17.734
And the temperature difference

00:05:17.734 --> 00:05:21.779
between above and below ground,
thanks to convection, creates

00:05:21.904 --> 00:05:26.492
this steady flow of air
throughout the structure.

00:05:26.576 --> 00:05:28.411
The focal point of the city

00:05:28.411 --> 00:05:32.123
